<title>AUSTRALIA: George Weston half year net profit rises.</title>
<headline>George Weston half year net profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year to Jan 31</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		    40.85 vs 38.90</p>
<p>    Net				     34.15 vs 24.95</p>
<p>    Dividend (cents)		     9.50 vs 9.50</p>
<p>    Sales				  640.20 vs 618.29</p>
<p>    Other income			  23.04 vs 7.48</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)			   36.10 vs 26.40</p>
<p>    Abnormal items		  gain 8.77 vs nil</p>
<p>Dividend is 100 pct franked</p>
<p>Pay date May 15</p>
<p>Reg date May 6</p>
<p>    Tax				     15.47 vs 13.95</p>
<p>    Interest				 0.04 vs 0.24</p>
<p>    Depreciation			  21.79 vs 20.33</p>
<p>    Minorities				nil vs nil</p>
<p>NOTE: George Weston Foods Ltd is a bakery and flour milling group and is 78 percent owned by Associated British Foods Plc.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373 1800</p>
</text>
